        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 654-48, 4\" x 1/2\" x 72\" Ramp</b>\r\n<p>\r\n4\" wide x 1/2\" high x 72\" length aluminum ADA compliant ramp.   These 6 foot long ramps are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used for ADA compliance on floors with 1/2\" to 3/4\" high lip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMill finish Aluminum.  Packaged with #10 flat head zinc plated wood screws. Fluted top with typical wall thickness of .125\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/4-x-1-2-x-36-ramp-ngp-654-36\"><b>3 Foot Aluminum Ramp</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/4-x-1-2-x-48-ramp-ngp-654-48\"><b>4 Foot Aluminum Ramp</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 654-72 72\" Door Ramp\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .125 (1/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #10 FH Zinc Plated Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
